{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37731","headline":"蜀中三首 二 · 郑谷","name":"蜀中三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜无多雨晓生尘，草色岚光日日新。\n蒙顶茶畦千点露，浣花牋纸一溪春。\n扬雄宅在唯乔木，杜甫台荒绝旧邻。\n却共海棠花有约，数年留滞不归人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37731.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37731","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}